{"sha": "b2db4e03ec06c4cb8278a082295e1dcc7fbc07ccedd9af61a4d21621e2cecd7f", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=9.2cm, height=5.8cm,", "  xlabel={$t$}, ylabel={$T$},", "  xmin=0, xmax=10.5, ymin=0, ymax=88,", "  xtick={5,10}, ytick={20,50,80}]", "  \\addplot[omProp, dashed, domain=0:10.4] {20};", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:10.2, samples=60] {20 + 60*exp(-0.5*x)};", "  \\addplot[omDef!50, thick, domain=0:10.2, samples=60] {20 + 30*exp(-0.5*x)};", "  \\addplot[omDef!50, thick, domain=0:10.2, samples=60] {20 - 15*exp(-0.5*x)};", "  \\node[omProp, font=\\small, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:6.6,20.8)", "    {平衡解};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 无论初始温度如何，$T' = -k(T - 20)$ 的所有解", "都指数收敛于平衡解 $T = 20$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{方程 \\texorpdfstring{$y' = ay + f(x)$}{y' = ay + f(x)}}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[解集的结构]\\label{prop:g12:diffeq:general}", "设 $f$ 在区间 $I$ 上连续，$y_p$ 为", "下述方程的一个特解", "\\[", "y' = ay + f(x)", "\\]", "在 $I$ 上。则 $I$ 上的解恰为", "函数 $y = C\\eu^{ax} + y_p$，$C \\in \\R$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "同\\cref{thm:g12:diffeq:affine}，$y$ 为解当且仅当", "$z = y - y_p$ 满足", "$z' = (ay + f) - (ay_p + f) = az$，当且仅当 $z = C\\eu^{ax}$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{method}[猜测特解]\\label{met:g12:diffeq:particular}", "求一个与 $f$ \\emph{形式相同}的特解：", "\\begin{itemize}", "  \\item 若 $f$ 为 $n$ 次多项式，则试取 $n$ 次多项式；", "  \\item 若 $f(x) = \\alpha\\,\\eu^{kx}$ 且 $k \\neq a$，则试取 $y_p = \\beta\\,\\eu^{kx}$；", "  \\item 若 $f(x) = \\alpha\\,\\eu^{ax}$（共振情形），则试取", "        $y_p = \\beta x\\,\\eu^{ax}$。", "\\end{itemize}", "代入方程，并比较系数以确定待定常数。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g12:diffeq:particular}", "求解 $y' = 2y + 4x$。试取 $y_p = \\alpha x + \\beta$：", "$\\alpha = 2(\\alpha x + \\beta) + 4x$ 对所有 $x$ 成立，可得", "$2\\alpha + 4 = 0$ 且 $\\alpha = 2\\beta$，故 $\\alpha = -2$，$\\beta = -1$。", "通解为 $y = C\\eu^{2x} - 2x - 1$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:diffeq:1}", "在 $\\R$ 上求解：", "(a) $y' = 3y$，且 $y(0) = 2$；\\quad", "(b) $2y' + y = 0$，且 $y(0) = -1$；\\quad", "(c) $y' = -y + 5$，且 $y(0) = 0$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:diffeq:2}", "某细菌种群的增长速率与其数量成正比，", "每 $3$ 小时翻一番。写出该种群数量", "$N(t)$ 所满足的微分方程，并确定比例系数。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:diffeq:3}", "验证 $y_p(x) = x\\,\\eu^{x}$ 是方程 $y' = y + \\eu^x$ 的解，", "并求其在 $\\R$ 上的所有解。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:diffeq:4}", "求解 $y' = -2y + \\eu^{x}$，满足 $y(0) = 1$。", "（提示：求形如 $\\beta\\,\\eu^{x}$ 的特解。）", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:diffeq:5}", "碳-14 的半衰期为 $5730$ 年。一件考古样本", "中的碳-14 含量为活体生物的 $60\\%$。估算该样本的年龄。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:diffeq:6}", "水箱中盛有 $100$ L 纯水。每升含盐 $0.2$ kg 的盐水", "以 $5$ L/min 的速率流入，混合液（保持均匀）以相同速率流出。", "设 $m(t)$ 为时刻 $t$（以分钟计）时水箱中盐的质量。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 说明 $m' = 1 - \\dfrac{m}{20}$ 成立。", "  \\item 求解，并求 $m(t)$ 当 $t \\to +\\infty$ 时的极限，", "        并解释其实际意义。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:diffeq:7}", "质量为 $80$ kg 的跳伞运动员受重力作用下落，", "（$g = 9.8\\ \\text{m/s}^2$），空气阻力与速率成正比，使得", "其速率满足 $v' = g - \\frac{k}{m}v$，其中 $k = 16$ kg/s。", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在 $v(0) = 0$ 的条件下求解方程。", "  \\item 计算\\emph{终端速度} $\\lim_{t\\to+\\infty} v(t)$，以及", "        达到其 $95\\%$ 所需的时间。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:g12:diffeq:8}", "\\emph{（逻辑斯谛方程）}一个种群 $y(t) \\in \\intoo{0}{1}$（以最大种群数量的分数表示）", "满足下列方程：", "\\[", "y' = y(1 - y).", "\\]", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 令 $z = \\dfrac{1}{y}$，证明 $z$ 满足线性方程", "        $z' = -z + 1$。", "  \\item 求 $z$，再求 $y$，其中 $y(0) = \\frac{1}{10}$。", "  \\item 证明 $y(t) \\to 1$（当 $t \\to +\\infty$ 时），", "        并大致画出解曲线的形状。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}